SCOPE. This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

It does NOT cover dataset imagery, which is not ours to relicense:

  * VisA (visa_pcb1-visa_pcb4) - CC BY 4.0, attribution required.
  * MVTec AD (mvtec_transistor, mvtec_cable) - CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Non-commercial
    use only, and ShareAlike propagates to derivatives.

No dataset is redistributed here; data/ is git-ignored and both corpora are
fetched from their sources by scripts/ingest_visa.py and scripts/ingest_mvtec.py.
Screenshots under docs/screenshots/ depict the running UI and therefore contain
thumbnails derived from both corpora; they are included for documentation under
the attribution given above and inherit their source corpus's terms, not MIT.

Trained model artifacts inherit the constraints of the corpus they were fitted
on. This is why the registry UI states a licence per model rather than burying
it here.
